<p><strong>Price:</strong> $110. <strong>Wattage:</strong> 100W. <strong>Coverage:</strong> 2x2 ft. <strong>Best for:</strong> Budget growers who want performance</p>

<p>The TS-1000 is the <a href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Spider+Farmer+SF+1000+grow+light&tag=tabletopharve-20" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored">Spider Farmer</a>'s direct competitor at $20 less. Same Samsung LEDs. Same dimming. Same coverage. The difference is the spectrum leans slightly red (helps flowering) and the build quality feels 5% cheaper (the driver is exposed, not enclosed). Neither matters for actual plant growth. The <a href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Mars+Hydro+TS-1000+grow+light&tag=tabletopharve-20" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored">Mars Hydro TS-1000</a> grows plants just as well as the Spider Farmer.</p>

